    <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>UMLMDA profile for domain modelling (see &lt;EM>&lt;STRONG>Domain-Driven Design&lt;/STRONG>: Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software &lt;/EM>by Eric Evans)&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
  </ownedComment>
