    </eAnnotations>
    <ownedComment xmi:id="_RAQ8UMLPEd2dvJAjhl6k2g" annotatedElement="_-NUFkMLMEd2dvJAjhl6k2g">
      <eAnnotations xmi:id="_X2i3oMLPEd2dvJAjhl6k2g" source="uml2.extensions">
        <details xmi:id="_X2i3ocLPEd2dvJAjhl6k2g" key="addedInVersion" value="4"/>
      </eAnnotations>
      <body>Stereotype&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;classes&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;two&amp;nbsp;dimentional&amp;nbsp;temporal&amp;nbsp;validity.&amp;nbsp;It&amp;nbsp;contains&amp;nbsp;implicitly&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong>Temporal&lt;/strong>&amp;nbsp;and&#xD;
&lt;strong>Historical&lt;/strong>.&amp;nbsp;To&amp;nbsp;avoid&amp;nbsp;problems&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;stereotype&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;only&amp;nbsp;derived&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong>Temporal&lt;/strong>.</body>
    </ownedComment>
