      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>An entity is a domain class with an own identity. The identity must be defined by &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Id&amp;gt;&amp;gt; properties.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
