      </eAnnotations>
      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>A none abstract class marked as &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Entity&amp;gt;&amp;gt; has to have at least one identifier property marked as &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Id&amp;gt;&amp;gt;. If multiple &amp;lt;&amp;lt;Id&amp;gt;&amp;gt;s are defined, the order of appearance is relevant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
    </ownedComment>
